  **S-245** (17 CFR 270.6c-11); gap **G-31** (G-30 sub-routes (b) and (c) research); rejection **R-021**"*).
  **G-31 is CLOSED, with a *not found* verdict on both of its sub-routes, recorded in Cycle 42** (`cycle_notes.md`,
