classified **in-map at row 14** by the register's own **state inventory** (S-448, S-449), so entry 6 is a reason
**(iv)** entry; the never-named part is the **sovereign obligor instance** and the **watchlist / review-placement
sub-kind**. **After:** the reason-(iii) set is **five**, the two taken entries are named, and the reference set is
